{"duration_api_ms":1193386,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d6359c64-cde0-4e0d-bbb0-721f0f19e9a9","total_cost_usd":6.0891682,"usage":{"input_tokens":144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":204117,"cache_read_input_tokens":9921388,"output_tokens":123561,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":71087},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":204117,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":588,"cache_read_input_tokens":229040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":779,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":779},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1481,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0001586,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":144,"outputTokens":123561,"cacheReadInputTokens":9921388,"cacheCreationInputTokens":204117,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":6.089009599999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":71087,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":204117,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"extra_usage_disabled","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":79,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"All five deliverables are in `work/`, along with the analysis scripts.\n\n**The policy:** the network switches at the first chance. As soon as the 10 s minimum green has passed, it nearly always ends the green: 97% of its greens last 12 s. It gives the next green to the phase with the largest weighted queue. A halted car counts 1 and a moving car 0.5. Left-pocket cars count 1.3–1.8×. Lanes N1 and W0 count about half, and cars approaching upstream on the E/W lanes add a little to the E/W phases. A small preference based on the phase now green breaks near-ties. It keeps the current green only when the rest of the junction is almost empty: about 3% of decisions, mostly on EW-through.\n\n| file | agreement with network (recorded states, min green elapsed) | on the network's own runs | comparisons |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `rules_small.py` | 90.3% | 89.4% | 3 |\n| `rules_full.py` | 91.0% | 89.1% | 3 |\n\nBoth extend the green as often as the network (2.9%). Most disagreements are near-ties: where the network clearly prefers one phase (logit gap ≥ 2), the full rules agree 98%. Agreement drops to about 85% at the heaviest loads.\n\n**Possible weaknesses** (described in `EXPLANATION.md`, not changed in the rules): short greens with high yellow time, left turns postponed when everything is saturated, and lanes N1 and W0 under-weighted.\n\n**Predictions:** agreement 0.88 for both files; TTS 45.0 veh-h (small) and 44.9 veh-h (full), against the network's 44.5 on the dev episodes.","ttft_ms":1098,"type":"result","duration_ms":1219461,"uuid":"3dfff597-a8b9-46b1-af96-6d5cec7cd2f3","ttft_stream_ms":950,"time_to_request_ms":87,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":3,"system_prompt":7,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":1,"input_attachments":11,"input_hooks":1,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":3,"tool_pool_refresh":3,"init_message":3,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_e